      "contents": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-02b31a30-39a2-4f25-96da-52e09cf056b7\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-aecf437d-4e47-4ee7-bb64-f670e7abe88b\"><span style=\"color:#141414;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4d8a1062-ac37-4f9a-a05e-3ff21515951f\"><b>【콜라보 기간 한정 Pick Up 모집 기간 안내】</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2d32e882-8bfa-4a7d-b2cd-fc335920c27c\"><span style=\"color:#141414;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-bc7b6130-b850-4a53-bf22-ce0da9c096a4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-57c1813d-657a-4b26-97ce-7a4bb4feebc3\"><span style=\"color:#141414;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b6fb7f1e-ab95-4d5e-86b1-99a97d717d55\">조용한 의지의 칼날 「2B」 전장 합류!​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6fb17269-a6f5-4df0-85bd-e8b54c1e72b9\"><span style=\"color:#141414;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-efbe6546-b3e1-444f-acf0-6715c1d81328\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-76d6187f-10b2-44e8-b018-860a080730c4\"><span style=\"color:#141414;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b98d444c-dcd5-459c-ad18-62f1c6ad0d00\">콜라보 이벤트 기간 중 2B 캐릭터를 획득하고, </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d1df9c15-8b80-4576-a6a8-3743a8b5dcf8\"><span style=\"color:#141414;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6362e580-4e07-42b0-9196-07b032a24252\">OuteR:Automata 이벤트 업적을 완료하면</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-17534e74-8da2-40a3-9fd0-10cb1891a9b1\"><span style=\"color:#141414;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-afbed8f2-87cf-49f0-9a7b-641b36b46735\">2B 코스튬 [중파상태]를 획득할 수 있습니다!</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5358e238-cce1-4adb-b907-e664646faeb1\"><span style=\"color:#141414;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f5769a92-68fd-4267-a740-87846dd332a4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a3ab15e1-459d-40cf-b24d-e204f94ce4b8\"><span style=\"color:#141414;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f687a724-561e-46d8-9241-6a7b1f6d08d4\"><b>◆ Pick Up 모집 기간 </b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-eca30456-30cd-42f4-b3c0-97924ad90f00\"><span style=\"color:#141414;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6cb64441-a7cc-445e-b089-cc2239714f51\">- 7/3(목) 점검 완료 후 ~ 7/31(목) 4:59까지</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3f022970-2e01-4431-ae9f-640062ee1767\"><span style=\"color:#141414;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ba06eb75-8172-4106-9dc6-ce1e732578b6\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9351c937-90e3-4e09-966a-afb1fbef7a99\">